{"seq":3,"slug":"automation-and-toolchain","title":"自动化与工具链","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/automation-and-toolchain","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"eliminating-toil-scaffolding","title":"消除重复劳动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/automation-and-toolchain/eliminating-toil-scaffolding","wordCount":2855,"readingTime":12},{"seq":2,"slug":"pre-commit-local-quality-gates","title":"pre-commit 与本地质量门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/automation-and-toolchain/pre-commit-local-quality-gates","wordCount":2727,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"ci-as-developer-experience","title":"CI 作为开发者体验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/automation-and-toolchain/ci-as-developer-experience","wordCount":2821,"readingTime":12}],"introMarkdown":"# 自动化与工具链 简介\n\n凡是开发者**反复手动做的事**，都是自动化的机会——重复劳动既慢又易错，还消磨人。本章讲清用自动化与工具链消除这些摩擦：先是**消除重复**（脚手架、代码生成、Makefile/任务运行器把多步操作变成一条命令），然后是 **pre-commit 与本地质量门**（lint/format/hook 在提交前、本地就拦住问题，而非等到 CI 或 review），最后是 **CI 作为 DX**（把 CI 当成开发者体验的一部分——快、缓存、清晰的失败信息，而非又慢又看不懂的黑盒）。好的自动化让正确的事变成默认、让开发者把精力留给真正需要思考的部分。\n"}